        <xpdl2:Activity Id="_aFehoInLEei_vveVpSHBgw" Name="Precondizioni" IsATransaction="false" xpdExt:Visibility="Private" xpdExt:RequireNewTransaction="false" xpdExt:DisplayName="Precondizioni">
          <xpdl2:Implementation>
            <xpdl2:Task>
              <xpdl2:TaskScript>
                <xpdl2:Script ScriptGrammar="JavaScript">var off = DataUtil.createList();&#xD;
off.add(&quot;BITSTREAMGBEASIMMETRICOFLAT&quot;);&#xD;
off.add(&quot;BITSTREAMATMASIMMETRICOFLAT&quot;);&#xD;
off.add(&quot;BITSTREAMATMASIMMETRICOHL&quot;);&#xD;
off.add(&quot;BITSTREAMATMASIMMETRICOLITE&quot;);&#xD;
off.add(&quot;EASYIPBASEPLUSFLAT&quot;);&#xD;
off.add(&quot;EASYIPBASEPLUSLITE&quot;);&#xD;
off.add(&quot;EASYIPSPECIALPROFILEFLAT&quot;);&#xD;
off.add(&quot;EASYIPSPECIALPROFILELITE&quot;);&#xD;
off.add(&quot;BITSTREAMNGAFTTCAB&quot;);&#xD;
off.add(&quot;BITSTREAMNGAFTTH&quot;);&#xD;
off.add(&quot;VULAFTTCAB&quot;);&#xD;
off.add(&quot;VULAFTTH&quot;);&#xD;
off.add(&quot;EASYIPBASEPLUS&quot;);&#xD;
off.add(&quot;EASYIPSPECIALPROFILE&quot;);&#xD;
off.add(&quot;BITSTREAMATMASIMMETRICO&quot;);&#xD;
&#xD;
&#xD;
EseguiControllo = false;&#xD;
&#xD;
var tipologiaLineaReq = &quot;&quot;;&#xD;
tipologiaLineaReq = null;&#xD;
&#xD;
// recupera TIPO LINEA da XML in input&#xD;
var i = 0;&#xD;
	&#xD;
while(tipologiaLineaReq == null &amp;&amp; i &lt; localRequest.ordine.dettaglioordine.size())&#xD;
{&#xD;
	var currentDettOrdine = localRequest.ordine.dettaglioordine.get(i);&#xD;
		&#xD;
	if(String(currentDettOrdine.nomeComponente).slice(0, 7) == &quot;ACCESSO&quot;)&#xD;
	{&#xD;
		var j = 0;&#xD;
		while(tipologiaLineaReq == null &amp;&amp; j &lt; currentDettOrdine.attributiDettaglioOrdine.size())&#xD;
		{&#xD;
			var currentAttDettOrdine = currentDettOrdine.attributiDettaglioOrdine.get(j);&#xD;
				&#xD;
			if(currentAttDettOrdine.nomeAttributo == it_telecomitalia_it_NOW_casedata_DizionarioAttributiEnumeration.TIPOLINEA)&#xD;
			{&#xD;
				tipologiaLineaReq = currentAttDettOrdine.valoreAttributo;&#xD;
			}&#xD;
			j++;&#xD;
		}&#xD;
	}&#xD;
	i++;&#xD;
}&#xD;
&#xD;
&#xD;
if (ConsistenzaFonia != null)&#xD;
{&#xD;
&#xD;
	if(localRequest.lavorazione == it_telecomitalia_it_NOW_casedata_LavorazioneEnumeration.MIGRAZIONE &amp;&amp; off.contains(String(localRequest.offerta)) &amp;&amp; tipologiaLineaReq != null &amp;&amp; tipologiaLineaReq != &quot;LineaNonFonia&quot;)&#xD;
	{&#xD;
&#xD;
		EseguiControllo = true;&#xD;
	&#xD;
	}&#xD;
	else if (localRequest.lavorazione == it_telecomitalia_it_NOW_casedata_LavorazioneEnumeration.ATTIVAZIONE)&#xD;
	{&#xD;
&#xD;
		EseguiControllo = true;&#xD;
&#xD;
	}&#xD;
	&#xD;
}</xpdl2:Script>
